  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Initiation Phase Digitalization for Efficiency and Resiliency in Civil Registration Project is a response to challenges in the digital sphere caused by Russia&#x2019;s large-scale aggression against Ukraine with the view of general improvement of stability and efficiency of functioning of the system of state registration of civil status acts.The project strategy is aligned with the priorities of the Government of Ukraine, UNDP Strategic Plan (2022-2025), and the UNDP Country Programme Document. Dig</narrative>
  </description>
